										For many insurance agents, it seems there just aren’t enough hours in the day to accomplish everything you need to and still ensure you’re providing an exceptional customer experience. Join multiple award winner <b>Sean Morton @ 2:00 pm ET on Wednesday, January 29, 2020</b> as he shares tips and insights for using technology and systems to run a more efficient insurance agency and learn how to “architect” your agency to create an outstanding customer experience (hosted by top agent Chandler Hahn).
<br>
									<br>
										Sean will share his journey from barely getting his contract to earning some of the top awards in his company.  He will also share invaluable tips and insights from his SPEED training, with a focus on efficiency and creating an exceptional customer experience from prospect to policy.
									</td>
